    "type": "math_show",
    "q": "Find the equation for the graph in the following illustration.Give your answer in the form $y=a\\cos bx$, where $a$ and $b$ are real numbers.<br><br><div style='width: 300px; height: 300px; margin: 20px auto; border: 1px solid #444; padding: 10px; background: #1e1e1e; border-radius: 8px;'><svg viewBox='0 0 400 400' width='100%' height='100%' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><line x1='0' y1='200' x2='400' y2='200' stroke='#FFFFFF' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='200' y1='0' x2='200' y2='400' stroke='#FFFFFF' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M 135 280 C 141 250, 147 220, 153 200 C 171 120, 182 120, 200 120 C 218 120, 229 120, 247 200 C 265 280, 276 280, 294 280 C 312 280, 323 200, 341 200 C 347 200, 353 180, 359 150' fill='none' stroke='#00EEFF' stroke-width='4'/> <text x='190' y='115' fill='white' font-size='14'>4</text> <text x='175' y='295' fill='white' font-size='14'>-4</text> <text x='205' y='215' fill='white' font-size='14'>0</text> <text x='130' y='215' fill='white' font-size='14'>-3π/4</text> <text x='235' y='215' fill='white' font-size='14'>3π/4</text> <text x='330' y='215' fill='white' font-size='14'>9π/4</text> <text x='385' y='215' fill='white' font-size='14'>x</text> <text x='205' y='15' fill='white' font-size='14'>y</text> <path d='M 359 150 L 362 140 L 354 146' fill='none' stroke='#00EEFF' stroke-width='2'/> <path d='M 135 280 L 132 290 L 140 284' fill='none' stroke='#00EEFF' stroke-width='2'/> </svg></div>",
    "c": "<strong>အဖြေရှင်းလင်းချက်:</strong><br><br>From the graph, the maximum value is $4$ and the minimum value is $-4$.<br><br>The amplitude $a$ is given by:<br><br>$$a = \\frac{\\max - \\min}{2} = \\frac{4 - (-4)}{2} = 4$$<br><br>The graph has a minimum at $x = -\\frac{3\\pi}{4}$ and the next minimum at $x = \\frac{3\\pi}{4}$. The mark at $x = \\frac{9\\pi}{4}$ is one period later, not the next minimum.<br><br>The period $P$ is the distance between consecutive minimums:<br><br>$$P = \\frac{3\\pi}{4} - \\left(-\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\\right) = \\frac{6\\pi}{4} = \\frac{3\\pi}{2}$$<br><br>The formula for the period of $y = a\\cos(bx)$ is $P = \\frac{2\\pi}{b}$.<br><br><div class=\"math-line\">\\(\\frac{3\\pi}{2} = \\frac{2\\pi}{b}\\)</div><div class=\"math-line\">\\(\\implies b = \\frac{4}{3}\\)</div><br><br>Substitute $a$ and $b$ into the equation:<br><br>$$y = 4\\cos\\left(\\frac{4}{3}x\\right)$$<br><br><strong>$y=4\\cos\\frac{4}{3}x$</strong><br><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 330\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cosine graph with the marked scale\" data-chapter-graph=\"1\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#1e1e1e\"/><defs><clipPath id=\"cg365\"><rect x=\"50\" y=\"30\" width=\"386\" height=\"258\"/></clipPath></defs><line x1=\"87.4\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"87.4\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"260.3\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"260.3\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"346.8\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"346.8\" y2=\"288\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"240.4\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"240.4\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"77.6\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"77.6\" stroke=\"#2A3548\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"159.0\" x2=\"436\" y2=\"159.0\" stroke=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><polygon points=\"436,159.0 428,155.0 428,163.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"/><text x=\"434\" y=\"151.0\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\">x</text><line x